{
  "about": "Components of Atollo, in install order (docs/app/CATALOG.md). key: file (or non-empty folder) that shows the component is installed, relative to data\\apps\\win32-<arch>; '@' = relative to the kit root. keys: its other parts (Maven, Ninja, Composer...), same rules as key: the component is installed only when the key and all of them exist. folder: what the component owns in data\\apps (removed when the component is turned off). x64Only: the x64 build is used on ARM64 too (emulation). noArm64: no build runs on ARM64, not even emulated: not available on ARM64 kits. remove: other files or folders the component owns (relative to data\\apps\\win32-<arch>, @ = kit root), removed with it unless another installed component lists them too. check: version command of the final check, program (same rules as key) and arguments. group app: part of Atollo itself (the editor), not shown in Linguaggi e strumenti, always installed at the version and SHA-256 fixed here for this release. desc: Italian, translated by the catalogs.",
